<title>HUNGARY: Richter buys 25,000 own shares.</title>
<headline>Richter buys 25,000 own shares.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian pharmaceuticals company Richter bought 25,000 own shares, Richter said in a statement in the Budapest Stock Exchange's (BSE) official gazette on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company did not disclose the price at which it had bought the shares.</p>
<p>Richter announced on Friday that it had authorised a brokerage to buy 25,000 Richter shares on its behalf on the stock exchange.</p>
<p>Richter closed at 8,520 forints on the BSE on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
